            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>🧬</span> Dominant Formulation Drivers
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Permutation &amp; standardized coefficient sensitivity weights</p>
